I agree, mostly - I do not think that walking around is like attacking
things until I walk into something that hurts! But I would prefer 
in nethack that walking and fighting were different types of movement. 
Partly because this would change the whole feel of the game - no longer
is every movement aggressive - now you could choose when you wished
to be actively agressive and when not - this is a fantasy I would like
to try! And partly because I suffer from the problems of slow play
on the rare occasions when I play over a modem - its so ghastly compared
to playing properly that it amazes me that anyone who has to play at such
speeds all the time ever gets anywhere.

I would not like to have the system ask me whether or not I meant to attack -
this is something I find annoying when it becomes excessive.

